src/oracles/Curve2TokenOracle.sol:_lpTokenValue:88|C2|Medium|An unprivileged attacker flashloans ~13% of a Curve stableswap's TVL and swaps it one-sided immediately before a liquidation tx, pushing the fee-inclusive get_dy probe below the 0.99e18 lower limit so _calculateLPTokenValue's deviation require reverts and takes every entrypoint of the LP oracle offline, blocking the liquidation of the attacker's own underwater vault position (and every other position priced by this LP) for pure round-trip swap fees, then back-runs the reverse swap in the same block — repeating per block until the position is deeply insolvent and the loss lands on the protocol.|src/oracles/Curve2TokenOracle.sol
